  "bodyHash": "Y/nNuaOuyIA=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Simple Hats 是一款基于JSON配置的装饰性帽子模组，允许用户自定义包含多种扩展功能的帽子，如款式变体、染色功能、粒子特效和季节性限定等。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">模组默认内置近300顶特色帽子，用户可自由增删改。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/468/649/hats.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"1752\" height=\"945\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>特色功能：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 帽子可通过击杀敌对生物掉落的惊喜礼包（右键开启）获取，或从各类战利品箱中发现</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 多余或重复的帽子可回收用于合成新礼包，以获取更稀有款式</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 帽子可放置在可制作的展示架上进行陈列</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 部分帽子含有多款模型/材质，可在工作台中循环切换</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 部分帽子支持类似皮革的染色功能，并可用炼药锅清洗</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 部分帽子带有粒子特效，第三人称视角或其他玩家可见</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 内置季节系统，特定时段普通礼包会掉落节日限定礼包</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>0.3.0版本更新：</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> &nbsp;&nbsp; 新增ArtsyDy创作的60+顶新帽子。注意：从旧版本升级需删除simplehats.json文件以重新生成配置获取新内容</span></span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/668/hatsnew2.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"1565\" height=\"618\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>0.2.0版本更新：</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"> &nbsp;&nbsp; 新增StarArtsy创作的30+顶新帽子，包含为Trinkets and Baubles模组设计的泰迪熊帽子</span><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/650/961/hatsnew.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"772\" height=\"523\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>特殊配方：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">按稀有度回收多余帽子：</span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/494/scrapcommon.PNG\" alt=\"帽子回收（基于稀有度）\" width=\"300\" height=\"152\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">升级材料稀有度或按稀有度合成礼包：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/493/scrapcrafting.PNG\" alt=\"材料升级 &amp; 礼包合成（基于稀有度）\" width=\"300\" height=\"322\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">为非酋准备的默认可合成帽子（或特别幸运的人 :) ）：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/492/simplehat.PNG\" alt=\"默认可合成帽子（献给非酋们 :) ）\" width=\"300\" height=\"151\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">切换帽子款式：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/491/variant.PNG\" alt=\"款式循环切换\" width=\"300\" height=\"152\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">染色功能：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"http://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/469/490/dye.PNG\" alt=\"帽子染色\" width=\"300\" height=\"142\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>依赖项（Fabric/NeoForge 1.21.1及以上）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>必选： </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Accessories：帽子通过饰品栏装备</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; owo-lib：处理模组配置文件</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>依赖项（Forge 1.20.4及以下）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>必选： </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Curios：帽子装备在饰品槽位</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>可选： </strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; JEI：支持在JEI中显示自定义配方</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Optifine：安装后自动启用多款帽子的发光材质（推荐）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>依赖项（Fabric 1.20.4及以下）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>必选：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Trinkets：帽子装备在饰品栏\"帽子\"槽位</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Cloth Config：用于非JSON配置选项</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <strong>可选：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Continuity 或 Optifine+Optifabric：安装后自动启用发光材质（推荐）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Mod Menu：支持在游戏中通过模组菜单修改配置</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>发现问题请通过页面顶部的GitHub问题追踪系统反馈！</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>需要联系Fonny？<span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\">（问题/漏洞）</span>点击下方徽章（Fonny开发社区Discord）：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZPdwrtvBKm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1202561752294760478?labelColor=violet&amp;color=purple\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"39\"></strong></span></a></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kfVjTWVz7N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>捐赠者可获专属福利，包括定制帽子！</strong></span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kfVjTWVz7N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fstarartsy\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/starartsy</a></strong></span></span></span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fBSJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/546e6fab-b6da-4f3f-b9ea-eaa0cdaffafe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"150\"></a></span></p>",
